#: ../../data/evi.rst:2
msgid "EVI (Sentinel-2)"
msgstr "EVI (Sentinel-2)"

#: ../../data/evi.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **Enhanced Vegetation Index** is a second vegetation index. It uses "
"the blue band to correct for the atmosphere and does not level off as "
"quickly as the NDVI over very dense vegetation. The formula is ``EVI = "
"2.5 * (NIR - red) / (NIR + 6 * red - 7.5 * blue + 1)``."
msgstr ""
"Der **Enhanced Vegetation Index** ist ein zweiter Vegetationsindex. Er "
"verwendet das blaue Band, um die Atmosphäre zu korrigieren, und flacht "
"über sehr dichter Vegetation nicht so schnell ab wie der NDVI. Die Formel"
" lautet ``EVI = 2.5 * (NIR - red) / (NIR + 6 * red - 7.5 * blue + 1)``."

#: ../../data/evi.rst:13
msgid ":func:`~cdec.download_enhanced_vegetation_index`, short ``download_evi``"
msgstr ":func:`~cdec.download_enhanced_vegetation_index`, kurz ``download_evi``"

