msgid ""
"Sentinel-2 Level-2A (collection ``SENTINEL2_L2A``), bands B12 (shown as "
"red), B11 (green) and B04 (blue)"
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-2 Level-2A (Collection ``SENTINEL2_L2A``), Bänder B12 (als Rot "
"gezeigt), B11 (Grün) und B04 (Blau)"

#: ../../data/false-color-urban.rst:20
msgid "10 m (B11 and B12 have 20 m detail)"
msgstr "10 m (B11 und B12 haben 20 m Detailgenauigkeit)"

#: ../../data/false-color-urban.rst:43
msgid ""
"False-colour urban image of Bremen: green vegetation, black river and "
"lakes, grey city, white patches without data."
msgstr ""
"Falschfarben-Stadtbild von Bremen: grüne Vegetation, schwarzer Fluss und "
"Seen, graue Stadt, weiße Stellen ohne Daten."

#: ../../data/false-color-urban.rst:52
msgid ""
"**A fixed stretch.** The reflectance 0 to 0.4 becomes 0 to 255, and the "
"brightest values are compressed instead of clipped. No statistics of the "
"image are used, so the same reflectance always gets the same colour and "
"images of different dates or places can be compared by eye (:doc:`/howto"
